  "premise": "An M2.x model version that combines OHLCV readings and event votes across volume, participation, flow, structure, cross-asset, and session context produces a forward directional prediction with lift over a direction-matched base, after costs, on model_dev.",
  "economic_rationale": "Each information area measures a different market mechanism. A vote that requires agreement across independent areas should filter noise, while the area cells test whether one mechanism carries information on its own. The exploratory cells guarantee coverage; the five primary cells are the only confirmatory cells.",
